{[#]} 1. Bc6# {The Balestra Mate sees exemplary coordination between a queen
and a bishop. The queen ends up protecting the flight squares and the bishop
delivers the checkmate. The name is somewhat obscure. Balestra is a fencing
term, meaning to step forward and then lunge, which is relatable to the final
jab by the bishop.} *

